Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 18:49:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] v8: handle multi-slot stack aliasing in move optimization
 (4db782064e, crbug 581962456)

[M156] register allocator fix that V8 15.6 shipped as 15.6.75.80. It
applies to 15.6.75.66 on top of the previous commit (5dde7daf0a), whose
instruction.h change is in its context; that patch now holds both. With
the unittests and the mjsunit test regress/wasm/regress-simd-581962456.js.
The cache epoch bump to 40 covers it. Notes in
patches/v8/FLYWEB-SECURITY.md.

